277 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Kia India imports a significant portion of components, including semiconductors, transmission systems, and specialized electronics, from global suppliers. Disruptions like the global chip shortage and Red Sea shipping crisis have led to production delays, extended waiting periods for popular models \(e.g., Seltos, Carens\), and increased logistics costs.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [18]
>>
