279 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Changes in Indian automotive policies especially in emissions standards \(transition to BS6 Phase II\), EV adoption mandates, and safety regulations can require expensive re-engineering. Fluctuating import duties on components, changes in GST rates for hybrid/EV segments, and state-level EV subsidies also pose compliance and cost risks. Delays or reversals in EV policy incentives can disrupt investment timelines)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [13]
>>
